{
  "slug": "billingplane",
  "name": "Billingplane",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Guardrails-first Stripe billing integration. Audit existing billing code, discover requirements, implement bulletproof billing, and validate edge cases. Zero runtime dependencies — knowledge stays in your codebase.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **1 agent**, **4 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `billing-patterns` (Billing model decision framework for SaaS applications), `stripe-billing` (Stripe billing guardrails for SaaS applications)\n- **Agents** (1): `webhook-validator` (Specialist agent for validating Stripe webhook handler implementations)\n- **Commands** (4): `audit` (Audit your codebase for Stripe billing violations, security risks, and missing edge case handling), `discover` (Interactive discovery to understand your billing requirements before writing any code), `feature-gating-requirements`, `implement` (Implement Stripe billing based on BILLING_REQUIREMENTS.md)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install billingplane@claude-community` from `kamesh231/billingplane`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
